              "plain_text": "framing",
              "href": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Framing_(social_sciences)"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": {
                "content": "” mà ta thường nghe trong quá trình problem solving. “In social theory, framing is a schema of interpretation, a collection of anecdotes and stereotypes, that individuals rely on to understand and respond to events. In other words, people build a series of mental \"filters\" through biological and cultural influences. They then use these filters to make sense of the world. “ (From Wikipedia).",
                "link": null
